# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env.example — API Key Template for Well Report Analyzer
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to:  .env
# 2. Paste in the key for whichever provider you are using
# 3. Set LLM_PROVIDER in llm_clients.py to "openai", "anthropic", or "gemini"
# 4. Never commit .env to git — it is already listed in .gitignore
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── OpenAI — https://platform.openai.com/api-keys ────────────────────────────
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...

# ── Anthropic Claude — https://console.anthropic.com/ ────────────────────────
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...

# ── Google Gemini — https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey ───────────────────
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...

# ── OCR support (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave blank if Tesseract / Poppler are already on your system PATH,
# or if you do not need OCR for scanned PDFs.
#
# Windows example (adjust version numbers and username as needed):
#   TESSERACT_EXE=C:\Users\<you>\AppData\Local\Programs\Tesseract-OCR\tesseract.exe
#   POPPLER_BIN=C:\Users\<you>\AppData\Local\Programs\poppler\poppler-XX.XX.X\Library\bin
#
# Linux / macOS — install via package manager (apt/brew) and leave these blank.
TESSERACT_EXE=
POPPLER_BIN=
